        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod buffer lifecycle helpers",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod buffer lifecycle helpers\n\nAdd a lod_buf_test kunit module covering three more pure-logic LOD\nhelpers that needed no new mock infrastructure:\n\n- lod_ea_store_resize() and lod_def_striping_comp_resize()/\n  lod_free_def_comp_entries(): per-thread buffer growth, no-op on a\n  smaller request, and release, all plain OBD_ALLOC_LARGE()-backed\n  lifecycle logic with no dt_object/OST/thandle involved.\n- lod_erase_dom_stripe(): removes a DoM component entry and its data\n  blob from an in-memory lov_comp_md_v1 via memmove(), shifting the\n  remaining entries/blobs and their offsets down. Made non-static and\n  exported to test it directly instead of only through its caller,\n  lod_dom_stripesize_choose().\n\nEXPORT_SYMBOL() added for lod_ea_store_resize(),\nlod_def_striping_comp_resize() and lod_free_def_comp_entries(), which\nwere previously only reachable from within lod.ko.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-4.5 [augment-cli]\nChange-Id: I0beee4bd94c7f8d97a865a869c1c280b1c5bfef3\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
